   "id": 54282,
   "url": "https://nishinomiya.goguynet.jp/2026/07/10/araebisu_260710/",
   "date": "2026-07-10",
   "title": "【西宮市】7月9日と10日は、西宮神社で「あらえびす夜祭（ヱビスビールフェスタ）2026」開催！現地の様子をレポートします♪",
   "html": "<p>2026年7月9日（木）と10日（金）に、<strong><a href=\"https://nishinomiya-ebisu.com/\">西宮神社</a></strong>で「あらえびす夜祭（ヱビスビールフェスタ）2026」が行われます。<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-54285\" src=\"https://nishinomiya.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/23/2026/07/bd071520ca67cab36da531eef5941c41.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" srcset=\"https://nishinomiya.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/23/2026/07/bd071520ca67cab36da531eef5941c41.jpg 1200w, https://nishinomiya.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/23/2026/07/bd071520ca67cab36da531eef5941c41-768x576.jpg 768w, https://nishinomiya.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/23/2026/07/bd071520ca67cab36da531eef5941c41-1024x767.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" /></p>\n<p>というわけで、7月9日（木）に現地に行ってきました。</p>\n<p>会場となる<span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>松林特設会場</strong></span>には、平日にもかかわらず多くの人が訪れています。<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-54284\" src=\"https://nishinomiya.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/23/2026/07/7bfe5bcc0be0b07b7c197f8c1a6a0424.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" srcset=\"https://nishinomiya.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/23/2026/07/7bfe5bcc0be0b07b7c197f8c1a6a0424.jpg 1200w, https://nishinomiya.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/23/2026/07/7bfe5bcc0be0b07b7c197f8c1a6a0424-768x576.jpg 768w, https://nishinomiya.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/23/2026/07/7bfe5bcc0be0b07b7c197f8c1a6a0424-1024x767.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" /></p>\n<p>フードを提供するテントを巡る、<strong>スタンプラリー</strong>も開催。<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-54288\" src=\"https://nishinomiya.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/23/2026/07/88ed25a8f8623948fb08e3052f0ed223.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" srcset=\"https://nishinomiya.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/23/2026/07/88ed25a8f8623948fb08e3052f0ed223.jpg 1200w, https://nishinomiya.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/23/2026/07/88ed25a8f8623948fb08e3052f0ed223-768x576.jpg 768w, https://nishinomiya.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/23/2026/07/88ed25a8f8623948fb08e3052f0ed223-1024x767.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" /></p>\n<p>それもあって、テーブルのあちらこちらで乾杯する様子も見られました。<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-54283\" src=\"https://nishinomiya.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/23/2026/07/950d59977e90a0295333b8bccbd5437a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" srcset=\"https://nishinomiya.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/23/2026/07/950d59977e90a0295333b8bccbd5437a.jpg 1200w, https://nishinomiya.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/23/2026/07/950d59977e90a0295333b8bccbd5437a-768x576.jpg 768w, https://nishinomiya.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/23/2026/07/950d59977e90a0295333b8bccbd5437a-1024x767.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" /></p>\n<p>前日の7月8日（水）に「今年の梅雨が明けたとみられる」と発表もあり、ビールを飲むには打って付けの日になりましたね。<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-54289\" src=\"https://nishinomiya.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/23/2026/07/dc5c914b97fd6e352f97e22e2213b2ef.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" srcset=\"https://nishinomiya.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/23/2026/07/dc5c914b97fd6e352f97e22e2213b2ef.jpg 1200w, https://nishinomiya.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/23/2026/07/dc5c914b97fd6e352f97e22e2213b2ef-768x576.jpg 768w, https://nishinomiya.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/23/2026/07/dc5c914b97fd6e352f97e22e2213b2ef-1024x767.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" /></p>\n<p>また、南宮神社横の駐車場には<strong>猿回しのステージ</strong>も設置。<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-54286\" src=\"https://nishinomiya.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/23/2026/07/659b0312632d607043cbe15cb869d889.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" srcset=\"https://nishinomiya.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/23/2026/07/659b0312632d607043cbe15cb869d889.jpg 1200w, https://nishinomiya.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/23/2026/07/659b0312632d607043cbe15cb869d889-768x576.jpg 768w, https://nishinomiya.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/23/2026/07/659b0312632d607043cbe15cb869d889-1024x767.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" /></p>\n<p>子供たちを大いに喜ばせていました。</p>\n<p>ちなみに7月10日（金）は、沖恵美酒神社（あらえびす神社）の祭日で「<a href=\"https://nishinomiya-ebisu.com/2026/06/22/2028natsuebisu/\">夏えびす</a>」も開催。</p>\n<blockquote class=\"instagram-media\" data-instgrm-captioned data-instgrm-permalink=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Dal44jEk7AE/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" data-instgrm-version=\"14\" style=\" background:#FFF; border:0; border-radius:3px; box-shadow:0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width:500px; min-width:326px; padding:0; width:99.375%; width:-webkit-calc(100% - 2px); width:calc(100% - 2px);\">\n<div style=\"padding:16px;\"> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Dal44jEk7AE/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" style=\" background:#FFFFFF; line-height:0; padding:0 0; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; width:100%;\" target=\"_blank\"> </p>\n<div style=\" display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 40px; margin-right: 14px; width: 40px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center;\">\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 100px;\"></div>\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 60px;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 19% 0;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display:block; height:50px; margin:0 auto 12px; width:50px;\"><svg width=\"50px\" height=\"50px\" viewBox=\"0 0